<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" agent="Mozilla/5.0 (X11; Ubuntu; Linux x86_64; rv:148.0) Gecko/20100101 Firefox/148.0" version="29.6.1" pages="17">
  <diagram name="修改记录" id="gTVHc8mEZxcYWgZYEpAY">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1356" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="827" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="F50JbF06kuBHmhxBTeOH-1" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;p class=&quot;md-end-block md-p md-focus&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; line-height: inherit; orphans: 4; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;md-plain md-expand&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;VLN算法调用流程框图修改记录（任云鹤 2026年02月03日）&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;md-end-block md-p&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; line-height: inherit; orphans: 4; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; color: rgb(184, 191, 198);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;md-plain&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot; size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;1.建图定位算法：建图过程中，持续发布 3D点云地图增量数据,供APP订阅显示。建图完成后，app调用保存接口，将3D点云地图文件、灰度图文件和T_init配置落盘；&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;md-end-block md-p&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; line-height: inherit; orphans: 4; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; color: rgb(184, 191, 198);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot; size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;2.机器人定位算法：机器人启动时，计算初始位姿，需要传入3D点云地图文件和T_init配置的文件路径。运动过程中，计算实时位姿，不需要重复传入3D点云地图文件和T_init配置；&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;md-end-block md-p&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; line-height: inherit; orphans: 4; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; color: rgb(184, 191, 198);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;md-plain&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot; size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;3.语义建图算法：目标检测分割算法和语义建图算法是两个不同的程序；&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;md-end-block md-p&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; line-height: inherit; orphans: 4; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; color: rgb(184, 191, 198);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;md-plain&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot; size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;4.补充了跟随目标算法流程图；&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;md-end-block md-p&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; line-height: inherit; orphans: 4; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; color: rgb(184, 191, 198);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;md-plain&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot; size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;5.更新了导航规划和跟踪控制算法流程图；&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;md-end-block md-p&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; line-height: inherit; orphans: 4; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; color: rgb(184, 191, 198);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;md-plain&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot; size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;6.在算法模块标注所在的机器节点（控制板/jetson）和开发语言（c++/python）；&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;md-end-block md-p&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; line-height: inherit; orphans: 4; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;7.采用回调的方式接收传感器数据（雷达和相机）&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="420" width="560" x="110" y="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
